<title>PHILIPPINES: Zeus Holdings up 17.6 pct to 5.0 pesos.</title>
<headline>Zeus Holdings up 17.6 pct to 5.0 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Zeus Holdings Inc soared by 75 centavos, or 17.6 percent, to 5.0 pesos in midsession on news its shareholders had approved an increase in the company's authorised capital stock to 3.0 billion pesos from 100 million pesos, traders said.</p>
</text>
